<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9416" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντᾰμείβομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exchange</i> one thing <i>with</i> another, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν δελφῖσι θῆρες ἀνταμείψωνται
					νομόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archil.
					74.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> c.acc. pers.,
				<i>repay, requite, punish,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνταμείβεσθαί τινα κακοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					65
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακαῖσι ποιναῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					225
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παθὼν κακῶς κακοῖσιν ἀντημείβετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					1054
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνταμειψόμεσθά σ᾽ ὥσπερ εἰκὸς ἀντὶ
					τῶνδε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					723
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>answer again,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖσδε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.79
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τοὺς φίλους οἷ᾽ ἀνταμείβει
					ῥήματ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					814
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ οὐδέν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1273
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑμᾶς . . τοῖσδ᾽ ἀνταμείβομαι λόγοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					154
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
